Description: first-run setup and welcome guide for Zovelis OS
 Zovelis Welcome greets new users after installation. It lets them pick a
 light or dark appearance and a comfortable text size, shows whether the
 firewall and automatic security updates are switched on, and points to
 popular applications in the Software Center.
 .
 In the live session it offers to install Zovelis OS or keep trying it.
 .
 The only privileged action (turning automatic security updates on or off)
 is performed by a small helper started through pkexec, which requires an
 administrator password.
